{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android' data-target='computer\/os\/android' data-title='Android'>\r\n\t\t\tAndroid\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on ADB: ADB path, ADB over WiFi, Freeze background, logcat, ADB notes, and Run to debug, and related topics.","label":"ADB","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/android","label":"Android","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/android"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on ADB: ADB path, ADB over WiFi, Freeze background, logcat, ADB notes, and Run to debug, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>ADB path<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDefault adb locations in Android SDK platform-tools on Windows and Mac.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>ADB over WiFi<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPut adbd on TCP port 5555, connect over WiFi, and switch back to USB.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Freeze background<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSet RUN_IN_BACKGROUND appops to ignore or allow for a package.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>logcat<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFilter adb logcat, tag logs with Log.d, and show one tag exclusively with -s.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>ADB notes<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPush a file to device paths and set a property with adb shell setprop.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Run to debug<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStart an activity in debug wait with am start -D.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>WiFi debugging<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnable Wireless debugging, pair with a code, then adb connect.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path' data-title='ADB path'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>ADB path<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_wifi' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_wifi' data-title='ADB WiFi'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_wifi\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>ADB WiFi<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background' data-title='Freeze background'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Freeze background<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/logcat' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/logcat' data-title='logcat'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/android\/adb\/logcat\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>logcat<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/notes'